Consider the following Minimal API app.

```csharp
var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
var app = builder.Build();

app.Map("/users/{id:int}", (int id) 
    => id <= 0 ? Results.BadRequest() : Results.Ok(new User(id)) );

